OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBrisk winds. Rather cloudy with
OL,6,Fbest of limited brighter spells
OL,7,Fexpected in east and during the
OL,8,Fmorning. Some in east staying dry but
OL,9,Foccasional patchy rain about, this
OL,10,Ffocused west of the M74.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FWindy and cloudy. Rain soon
OL,13,Fextending from the west across the
OL,14,Fwhole area during the evening, perhaps
OL,15,Fturning heavy at times over west hills.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FCloud, rain, afternoon hill
OL,18,Fsnow, passing erratically late
OL,19,Fafternoon and through the evening as
OL,20,Fisolated showers and clear spells
OL,21,Ffollow from the northwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
