OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA
OL,6,Fband of rain and hill snow reaching
OL,7,Ffrom the south Tuesday. Otherwise
OL,8,Ffrosty starts, then dry with sunny
OL,9,Fspells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
